# UI theme

**IA / placement** → `.cursor/rules/where-screens-live.mdc`
(placement map; flat nav / hide-until-unlock / ≤90 s are not hard locks).
This rule is **tokens + chrome patterns** only.

When editing menus, overlays, sheets, or dialogs under `lib/ui/`:

1. Read **`docs/UI_THEME.md`**. Prefer import **`lib/ui/theme.dart`**.
2. **Phone-first / portrait only** (~360–430 px); tap / long-press, not hover-only.
3. Use **`GameTheme`** + **`MenuChrome`** colors/radii — **no `Color(0x…)` outside `game_theme.dart`** (combat VFX excepted). Enforced by `test/ui_theme_test.dart`.
4. **Pick the visual family:** menu sheet (≈ GEAR) vs hub vs combat HUD vs brand vs tooltip vs bottom nav (`nav*` slot fills — shop stays blue). Do not force GEAR chrome onto hub, dungeon, or the bar.
5. **Action hierarchy (2026-11-19):** one **amber** go face per screen or dialog for the main action; brown is secondary; grey / ghost for cancel and nav; `textLink` / ghost for nav; red for destructive. Actions → **`GameButton`** (`KenneyButton` is the same widget).
6. **Icons:** **`GameIcon` / `UiIcon` / `UiGlyph`** — never Material `Icons`, `ChoiceChip`, or emoji in chrome. Chase CTAs are plain English (`ENTER KEY`, not `🔑`). Dungeon party/target wells use `MenuChrome.hudWell`.
7. **IA copy:** RUN / TODAY / ACCOUNT — `scopeChip`, `sectionLabelScoped`, `tabBanner` for tab-owned status.
8. **Layout:** scroll, split flex, horizontal lists when content overflows — overflow stripes are bugs. Play scenes use `MenuChrome.playSafeArea` (no status-bar strip).
9. Dialog cancel → `MenuChrome.dialogCancel`; +/- → `stepperButton`.
10. Press Start (`GameTheme.pixel`) for combat HUD and tiny tags only — menu body uses `body`.

11. **Look (owner, 2026-11-17):** dusk palette from the "Skymning med hjältar" art — plum, amber, muted gold, browns. Brick Inc. Idle Breaker-style layout. Small visible button faces; hit areas stay `minTouch` 44 / `primaryTouch` 48.
12. **Text scale:** must read fully at `typeScaleMax` 1.45 on 360 dp. Wrap, scroll, or shorten copy — never `FittedBox` text shrinking.
13. **One exit per surface:** X / CLOSE on sheets; BACK only in stacked submenus.

English in-game copy. New shared helpers → `MenuChrome`, `GameButton`, or `GameIcon` + one line in `docs/UI_THEME.md`.
